Old World test branch update 1.0.85451 Test 2026-11-11

Note: This update is not available on GOG due to ongoing technical issues. We hope to have this resolved by the next update.

Design

Sentinel (Hunter family bonus) gives attack instead of strength
Increased the upkeep of laws that cost science (Divine Rule, Holy War, Autarky)
Polytheism gives 2 growth per acolyte in addition to existing effect
Re-added Free Crossbowman bonus tech card, requires Stirrups
Cooldown when using an allied unit lasts one turn, not two, so the acting player retains control of the unit the turn after using it
AI can help capture allied breached cities
Organized tribe raiders are less timid and have better target selection
Trade mission ambition no longer offered in multiplayer games
Tribe units are allowed to clear other tribe settlements without occupying them
Event balancing


Programming

Event system cleanup
Minor Unity upgrade to 6000.3.27f2
Minor RNG improvement
Added helper functions to compare player power, knowledge, and proximity in a way that does not rely on the ordering of infos entries (Important for mods only)
All bundles are now loaded before remapping materials, which helps mods that have a material that needs remapping to a shader that is in a different bundle


UI

Added an event option to remove the fog of war after a single player game has ended
Tiles now highlighted when appearing in Map Search results
Rotated Longbow and Beja Archer icons 90 degrees, to make more distinguishable from Archers and Medjay Archers
Trait helptext now lists all player characters with that trait instead of only notable characters (requires Advanced Help Text enabled)
Death of councilors, generals, governors, and agents re-added to turn summary
Grand Vizier notifications re-added to turn summary
Renamed "Units Killed" to "Military Units Killed" in the Records Screen
Adjusted slow and medium turn timers to have a higher base time but to increase less rapidly as the game progresses
Updated turn timer helptext for dynamic timers
When a sleeping or sentried unit levels up, it wakes up
Localization text updates


Bugs Fixed

Fixed stunned workers not having their non-Wonder improvement destroyed when forced off their tile
Fixed issue with family head not updating immediately in UI in some cases
Fixed left-click dragging sometimes rearranging buttons when it's not supposed to
Fixed civilian unit kills counting towards the military stats
Fixed a character opinion strength related load/save error
Fixed AI occupying city sites when it shouldn't
Fixed duplicate bonus card mention from culture tooltips
Fixed culture tooltips sometimes showing wrong player for enabled tech cards
Fixed unit cycling getting reset after upgrading the selected unit
Fixed modal events encountered during unit movement deselecting unit on dismissal
Event fixes
Fixed Hattusili introduction text
Fixed German text bugs
Fixed missing event subject validation log
Fixed Rise of Carthage scenario 3 load/save error
Fixed Heroes of the Aegean scenario 3 tribal marriage issues
